  "description": "*“The Deposed Empress, Lucentia, Is Executed!”*\n\nThe deposed Empress Lucentia was falsely accused of treason and beheaded. She managed to escape by faking her death through a prophetic dream, and under the new name “Rose,” she founded a trading company and amassed a fortune, but fate was not so kind to her. To survive, she sought out Duke Aitan, the Swordmaster, and asked him to become her guardian, but suddenly, “Kan” proposed that she become his “lover.” Thus begins the scandalous saga of Rose, the deposed empress once known as the “Black Witch.”\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes nine extra chapters.*",
